My Windows machine has a French keyboard.  That makes \ really
difficult.  Actually, of course, my Linux machine at home also
has a French keyboard.  But on both, I install the necessary
drivers so that I can use US, French or German, according to
what I'm doing.  With US as the default, because writing C or
C++ with anything else is a real pain (and I write C++ for my
living).

BTW, that's another plus for vim/emacs: both have modes which
allow composing accented characters using a US keyboard.  Where
I live an work, that's a real plus.

